@startuml

title Exercise 2: Read cell voltages.

actor Technician
participant "Diagnostic tool" as Tool
participant "BMS" as BMS
participant "Cell monitor (AFE)" as AFE

Technician -> Tool: Request cell voltages
activate Tool
Tool -> BMS : Read cell voltages
activate BMS
BMS -> AFE : Measure all 13 cells
activate AFE

AFE --> BMS : 13 voltages
deactivate AFE
BMS --> Tool : 13 voltages
deactivate BMS
Tool --> Technician : Show table
deactivate Tool
@enduml